       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TBCHDOCK.
       AUTHOR.              JEFF BUNGO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        FEBRUARY 1995.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.
      * THIS PROGRAM ALLOWS BATCH RECEIPTS INTO CSIS.
      * PROGRAM IS USED FOR PRAPS RECEIVER DOWNLOADS.

      *C
      *C 04/21/97  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   MODIFY PROGRAM TO PROCESS ASN'S FROM FRANCHISE VENDORS
      *C   TO PRECREATE RECEIVING SLIPS.  THESE ASN RECEIVING SLIPS
      *C   WILL HAVE A QUANTITY FOR ASN QUANTITY, BUT DELIVERED QTY
      *C   OF ZERO, SHOWING INTRANSIT.
      *C
      *C 10/30/97  CA YODER
      *C    ADDED CENTURY FOR DATABASE CHANGE TO MCFPCSTERM.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
      *C  07/28/99     CA YODER
      *C     CHANGED TC 324 TO INCLUDE DES MOINES PLANT WHEN MOVING
      *C     NEW QUANTITY TO TC RECORD INSTEAD OF ADJUSTED QTY.
      *C
      *C  05/15/00     CA YODER
      *C     CORRECTED LOGIC TO MOVE FREIGHT BILL DATE INFORMATION TO
      *C     DFREIGHT.  PROGRAM WAS NOT MOVING THE YEAR IF YEAR = ZERO.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  C01 IS NEW-PAGE.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
