           05  WORK-DATE-C            PIC X(2).
           05  WORK-DATE-YMD.
               10  WORK-DATE-Y        PIC X(2).
               10  WORK-DATE-M        PIC X(2).
               10  WORK-DATE-D        PIC X(2).

